有效的增值税发票。"}, {"clause_id": "C0017", "location": "第十四条 违约责任", "text": "第十四条 违约责任\n乙方无正当理由逾期支付转让款超过10日的，每逾期一日，应按逾期金额的万分之三向甲方支付违约金。\n甲方无正当理由拒绝办理专利权转让登记，且经乙方书面催告后15日仍未配合的，乙方有权解除合同。\n合同因甲方前述原因解除的，甲方应返还乙方已经支付的全部价款，并按合同总价款的10%向乙方支付违约金。\n甲方违反保密义务的，应赔偿乙方因此遭受的实际损失。\n除故意、重大过失、权属欺诈或者违反保密义务外，任何一方承担的累计赔偿责任原则上不超过本合同转让总价款。"}], "structured_total": null, "structured_percentages": [null, null], "structured_amounts": [480000, 360000]}, {"event": "[RULE_EXECUTED]", "source_rule": "analyze_payment_schedule", "invocation_count": 6, "call_sites": [{"module": "review_v2.technology_patent_transfer_analysis", "function": "analyze_patent_transfer", "line": 637, "invocation_count": 2}, {"module": "review_v2.technology_service_analysis", "function": "analyze_technology_relationship_risks", "line": 4965, "invocation_count": 2}, {"module": "review_v2.engine", "function": "_apply_technology_relationship_risk_layer", "line": 21328, "invocation_count": 1}, {"module": "review_v2.engine", "function": "_review_contract_v2_legacy", "line": 51925, "invocation_count": 1}], "input_document_hash": "080d21eb6600120c19cf2f103751232d0e14351baff5293ad0ecb443ee2ee94d", "output": {"status": "INSUFFICIENT_DATA", "contract_total": null, "contract_total_candidates": [], "percentage_total": 0, "amount_total": 840000, "amount_delta": null, "percentage_total_complete": false, "amount_total_complete": true, "nodes": [{"fact_id": "PAY-001-469643b30f", "source_document": "080d21eb6600120c19cf2f103751232d0e14351baff5293ad0ecb443ee2ee94d", "source_clause": "双方共同提交专利权转让登记申请后5个工作日内", "source_location": "line 34", "sequence": 1, "stage": "initial", "trigger": "双方共同提交专利权转让登记申请后5个工作日内", "condition": "双方共同提交专利权转让登记申请后5个工作日内", "percentage": null, "amount": 480000, "currency": "CNY", "payment_type": "initial", "is_deposit": true, "is_stage_payment": false, "is_final_payment": false, "is_retention": false, "raw_text": "双方共同提交专利权转让登记申请后5个工作日内支付480,000元", "start_offset": 736, "end_offset": 768, "context": "双方共同提交专利权转让登记申请后5个工作日内", "ret